        "slc_be4873f3d89a9de3b872de6079ec28186e00a2815dc40d2d379e69dfe835dc2f"
      ],
      "text": "In environments without a timestep limit or terminating mechanic, evaluation can appear to hang indefinitely while an episode never finishes; adding a step limit or action masking is suggested."
    },
