        "slc_e8b0ca30d8fa1e5c8da3ec78dc1dc32b279d281864b70dddb95f7c8740239fbf"
      ],
      "text": "Stoix is intentionally not a modular importable library; it follows a CleanRL/PureJaxRL-style philosophy allowing code duplication for readability, with abstraction used for networks, environments, logging, and evaluation."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6d8730257a673a97941c703f11ad383c3d54d352fba3971556aea31ffb7f4466",
