        "slc_c49b3ad7531b079a8e80a436a2bbfe0212df963cd26b0c74628248a5362dbd3f"
      ],
      "text": "All implementations include checkpointing to save and resume parameters and training runs, and training can be vectorized with vmap on one device or distributed with pmap across devices."
    },
